  "description": "A charming country house in a peaceful, scenic, rural setting overlooking Dunmanus Bay near Durrus village and Sheep's Head Peninsula and only a short distance away from Schull, Ballydehob and Bantry.\nThe house has been recently refurbished and comes with all the modern appliances and high speed fibre optic Internet connection. \nAll the 4 bedrooms have own ensuite bathrooms(+family bathroom with jacuzzi bath downstairs). Kitchen/dining area, utility room, office, sitting room & conservatory all with beautiful views. \nThere's also a sauna in the outbuilding. \nThis is a pet friendly accommodation with a fully enclosed, big garden. It has a gravel driveway and parking space for multiple vehicles. \nThe house is also suitable for sharing.",
